  "interpretation": "The primary omission reduction point estimate is positive, but its frozen family bootstrap interval crosses zero. Numerical changes are mixed: fully correct active counts and patch validity improve descriptively; wrong-prior fully correct counts, English wrong-value counts and uncertain-owner errors worsen. This pilot does not establish a reliable causal reduction in intention omissions or deployment benefit.",
  "limitations": [
    "Semantic categories are frozen independent model judgments, not human gold; this audit re-counts them without relabeling. Numerical agreement cannot establish semantic annotation correctness.",
    "Only 20 correlated held-out families, five single-step decisions each, one training seed and one checkpoint. This is not own-state rollout, final-answer evaluation, or a broad model comparison.",
    "Bootstrap resamples whole paired families; it measures variation over these families and does not include training, model-reviewer or decoding uncertainty. Secondary measures and subgroups are descriptive and were not given multiplicity-adjusted intervals.",
    "Wrong-prior subgroup has only 10 decisions and 36 active requirements; uncertain-owner denominator is eight. Do not treat their rates as precise population estimates.",
    "Each packet had one initial independent model review; only 37 packets had a second full semantic review. Expanded source-only review is not full state re-review. No interrater reliability was estimated.",
    "Reviewer streams received random hash assignment without forced arm balance. Aggregate reviewer-arm assignment counts are reported; reviewer-specific judgment differences can confound descriptive arm comparisons.",
    "One row pair crosses model-loading processes, so identical frozen files do not establish identical live quantized tensors. The pair remains included, with no rerun or post-hoc removal.",
    "The extra interrupted attempt has unknown output-token cost and bounded duration. Completed-call token and latency summaries exclude this incomplete attempt and are not full end-to-end cost estimates.",
    "Generation completed for all 200 calls; 15 runtime-invalid patches are distinct from failed generations. Invalid patches retained the input state and stayed in all quality denominators.",
    "No raw model outputs, semantic rationales, private identifiers or blind-ID/arm mapping are copied into this audit. Local filesystem chronology supports ordering but is not tamper-proof timestamp attestation."
  ],
